# LAHE user settings.
#
# Copy this file to ~/.config/lahe/user.env, or to $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/lahe/user.env
# when XDG_CONFIG_HOME is set. It lives outside the repository and is never
# committed. Plain KEY=value lines; lines starting with # are comments.
#
# An agent reads it at the start of a review. A key that is missing turns off
# the step that uses it, and the agent says so once.

# The folder where voice proposals go at the end of a review. If the folder has
# a README or charter, the agent reads it before writing a proposal.
# LAHE_VOICE_PROPOSALS_DIR=/path/to/voice_proposals

# The voice documents a proposal is checked against, separated by ":".
# LAHE_VOICE_DOCS=/path/to/communication_style.md:/path/to/writing_voice.md
